         plain="We took every 311 request the city closed in 2025-26 (city open data, csb.zip), counted each request once, and read the words the city closed it with. About 35 in every 100 closures say the job was scheduled, referred, added to a rotation or turned into a work order, not that it was done; the table of closing words and how each was classed can be downloaded and overruled.",
